 "description": "Returns a company's incorporation documents \u2014 certificate of incorporation, bylaws, incorporator action, board resolution, per-founder IP assignments and 83(b) elections, and the IRS EIN assignment letter (CP-575) \u2014 each with its filing and effective dates, jurisdiction, status and notes. Read-only. The 83(b) rows carry a statutory deadline: 30 days from the share issue, unreopenable, and filed by the founder personally, so a status of EXPIRED means the window closed, NOT that the founder failed to file. Sensitive rows (83(b), EIN) are returned only to a company owner or accountant.",
